sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    CS->>CSMS: AuthorizeRequest (idToken.idToken = <Configured invalid_idtoken_idtoken>, idToken.type = <Configured invalid_idtoken_type>)
    CSMS-->>CS: AuthorizeResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idTokenInfo.status must be Invalid or Unknown
